---
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<title>Spear & Shield - Untamed Weapons</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<nav class="nav">
			<div class="container">
				<a href="/" class="logo">UNTAMED</a>
				<div class="nav-links">
					<a href="/rules">Rules</a>
					<a href="/quick-reference">Quick Reference</a>
					<a href="/character">Characters</a>
					<a href="/bestiary">Bestiary</a>
					<a href="/gm-guide">GM Guide</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<main>
			<div class="container">
				<div class="breadcrumb">
					<a href="/character">← Back to Character Creation</a>
				</div>

				<header class="page-header">
					<div class="weapon-icon"><img src="/weapons/Spear and Shield.png" alt="Spear and Shield" /></div>
					<h1>Spear & Shield</h1>
					<p class="subtitle">Versatile / Tactical</p>
					<div class="stat-badges">
						<span class="stat-badge">+1 CON</span>
						<span class="stat-badge">+1 DEX</span>
						<span class="stat-badge">+1 AR</span>
					</div>
				</header>

				<article class="content">
					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Overview</h2>
						<p>The Spear & Shield is the weapon of hunters who want options. Masters of neither pure offense nor pure defense, S&S users thrive on tactical flexibility — locking down in Sentinel when the monster rages, snapping to Assault when an opening appears. Every tier of the weapon has two answers. The skill is knowing which one the moment demands.</p>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Weapon Attributes</h2>
						<div class="attributes-grid">
							<div class="attribute-card">
								<h3>Tags</h3>
								<ul>
									<li>Reach (10 ft)</li>
									<li>Thrown (20/60 ft)</li>
									<li>Recall — Rope Attached (Fast Action)</li>
									<li>Guard (can Block)</li>
									<li>Two-Handed</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
							<div class="attribute-card">
								<h3>Attack Stats</h3>
								<p><strong>Spear attacks:</strong> DEX mod + proficiency</p>
								<p><strong>Shield saves/DCs:</strong> CON mod + proficiency</p>
							</div>
							<div class="attribute-card">
								<h3>Save DC</h3>
								<p class="formula">10 + CON mod + proficiency</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="mechanic-details" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
							<p><strong>Basic Spear Thrust (1 Stamina):</strong> d20 + DEX mod + prof vs AR → weapon damage on hit.</p>
							<p style="margin-bottom: 0;"><strong>Thrown Spear:</strong> Range 20/60 ft. Recall your spear as a Fast Action (no Stamina cost) — the rope snaps it back to your hand.</p>
						</div>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section highlight">
						<h2>Core Mechanic — Stance Switch</h2>
						<p>The S&S hunter reads the fight in real time, shifting between an ironclad defensive posture and an aggressive skirmishing style as the moment demands.</p>
						<div class="mechanic-details">
							<h3>Stance Rules</h3>
							<ul>
								<li><strong>Switch Stance:</strong> Fast Action (1 Stamina). Only one stance active at a time.</li>
								<li><strong>Starting Stance:</strong> Choose on initiative roll — no Stamina cost.</li>
							</ul>

							<h3>Sentinel Stance</h3>
							<ul>
								<li><strong>+1 AR</strong> while active.</li>
								<li>Advantage on STR saves vs shove and knockdown.</li>
								<li>Advantage on DEX saves vs forced movement.</li>
								<li>Speed is <strong>halved</strong>.</li>
							</ul>

							<h3>Assault Stance</h3>
							<ul>
								<li><strong>+5 ft Speed</strong> while active.</li>
								<li>Once per turn: make a <strong>Fast Action spear jab</strong> (1 Stamina) against a target in reach — in addition to your normal Action.</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Damage Dice per Tier</h2>
						<table class="damage-table">
							<thead>
								<tr>
									<th>Tier</th>
									<th>Damage Dice</th>
								</tr>
							</thead>
							<tbody>
								<tr><td>Tier 1</td><td>1d8 + DEX</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 2</td><td>1d12 + DEX</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 3</td><td>2d8 + DEX</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 4</td><td>2d12 + DEX</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 5</td><td>3d8 + DEX</td></tr>
							</tbody>
						</table>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Techniques by Tier</h2>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T1 — Point & Pivot</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">Passive</div>
							</div>
							<p>No resource cost — just rewards playing your stance correctly.</p>
							<div class="stance-split">
								<div class="stance-block sentinel">
									<div class="stance-label">Sentinel</div>
									<p>When you successfully Block a melee attack, you may make one immediate <strong>counter-thrust</strong> against that attacker — <strong>0 Stamina, once per round</strong>.</p>
								</div>
								<div class="stance-block assault">
									<div class="stance-label">Assault</div>
									<p>After you hit with your Fast Action spear jab, you may <strong>shift 5 ft</strong> without provoking opportunity attacks.</p>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T2 — Shield Bash / Marked Javelin</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">Stance-Dependent</div>
							</div>
							<div class="stance-split">
								<div class="stance-block sentinel">
									<div class="stance-label">Sentinel — Shield Bash</div>
									<p><strong>2 Stamina • Reaction</strong></p>
									<p><strong>Trigger:</strong> You successfully Block a creature's attack.</p>
									<p><strong>Effect:</strong> Deal weapon die + CON modifier. Target makes a STR save vs your S&S DC:</p>
									<ul>
										<li><strong>Fail:</strong> Staggered (cannot Move next turn).</li>
										<li><strong>Fail by 5+:</strong> Stunned (1 turn). <em>Escalating Resistance applies.</em></li>
									</ul>
								</div>
								<div class="stance-block assault">
									<div class="stance-label">Assault — Marked Javelin</div>
									<p><strong>Passive</strong></p>
									<p>When you hit with a <strong>Thrown spear</strong>, the target is <strong>Marked</strong> until the end of your next turn:</p>
									<ul>
										<li>You and allies gain <strong>+1 to attack rolls</strong> vs the Marked target.</li>
										<li>Your next spear hit against it deals <strong>+1 Power Die</strong>.</li>
										<li>You must remain in Assault Stance to maintain the Mark.</li>
									</ul>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T3 — Guardian's Rally / Rapid Thrust</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">Stance-Dependent</div>
							</div>
							<div class="stance-split">
								<div class="stance-block sentinel">
									<div class="stance-label">Sentinel — Guardian's Rally</div>
									<p><strong>Passive upgrade to Block</strong></p>
									<p>You can <strong>Block for an ally within 5 ft</strong> (retargeting the attack to yourself). When you do:</p>
									<ul>
										<li>That ally gains <strong>+1 to their next attack roll</strong>.</li>
										<li>That ally <strong>recovers 1 Stamina</strong>.</li>
									</ul>
								</div>
								<div class="stance-block assault">
									<div class="stance-label">Assault — Rapid Thrust</div>
									<p><strong>3 Stamina • Action</strong></p>
									<p>Make <strong>two spear attacks</strong> against one target in reach.</p>
									<ul>
										<li>If <strong>both hit:</strong> add +1 Power Die to the total damage.</li>
										<li>A miss on one strike does not cancel the other.</li>
									</ul>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T4 — Bulwark / Skewer</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">Passive (both)</div>
							</div>
							<div class="stance-split">
								<div class="stance-block sentinel">
									<div class="stance-label">Sentinel — Bulwark</div>
									<p>Your <strong>first Block each round</strong> reduces that hit's damage by <strong>50%</strong>.</p>
								</div>
								<div class="stance-block assault">
									<div class="stance-label">Assault — Skewer</div>
									<p>Your spear attacks <strong>critically hit on 19–20</strong>.</p>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T5 — Unbreakable Aegis / Piercing Charge</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">Stance-Dependent</div>
							</div>
							<div class="stance-split">
								<div class="stance-block sentinel">
									<div class="stance-label">Sentinel — Unbreakable Aegis</div>
									<p><strong>Passive upgrade</strong></p>
									<p>Your first successful Block each round:</p>
									<ul>
										<li>Restores <strong>1 Stamina</strong>.</li>
										<li>Grants <strong>+1 AR</strong> until the start of your next turn.</li>
									</ul>
									<p>You may now <strong>Block for allies within 10 ft</strong> (Bastion-style retarget, not just 5 ft).</p>
								</div>
								<div class="stance-block assault">
									<div class="stance-label">Assault — Piercing Charge</div>
									<p><strong>3 Stamina • Action</strong></p>
									<p>Throw your spear up to <strong>30 ft</strong>. On hit: you <strong>pull yourself to the target</strong> and immediately make a <strong>melee follow-up attack with advantage</strong>.</p>
									<ul>
										<li>If the thrown attack <strong>misses</strong>, you don't move — your shield kept you anchored.</li>
										<li>If <strong>either hit crits</strong>: gain +5 ft Speed and +1 to attack rolls until the end of your next turn.</li>
									</ul>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section playstyle">
						<h2>Weapon Playstyle</h2>
						<div class="playstyle-grid">
							<div class="playstyle-card strengths">
								<h3>Strengths</h3>
								<ul>
									<li>Every technique tier has two answers — read the fight, pick the right one</li>
									<li>Thrown spear adds genuine range utility no other melee weapon has</li>
									<li>Sentinel becomes a meaningful team anchor (Guardian's Rally, Unbreakable Aegis)</li>
									<li>Assault's crit window (19–20) and Piercing Charge reward aggressive reads</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
							<div class="playstyle-card weaknesses">
								<h3>Weaknesses</h3>
								<ul>
									<li>Stance switching costs a Fast Action and Stamina — poor timing punishes you</li>
									<li>Sentinel halves speed — gets kited badly if the monster refuses to engage</li>
									<li>Neither the best tank nor the best damage dealer; both roles do one thing better</li>
									<li>Assault stamina drain (jab + switch costs) adds up fast at low tiers</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>
				</article>
			</div>
		</main>

		<style>
			* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
			:root {
				--forest-dark: #1a2e1a; --forest-green: #2d5016; --moss-green: #4a7c2f;
				--leaf-green: #6b9d3a; --amber: #d4a257; --earth-brown: #5c4033;
				--cream: #f5f1e8; --text-light: #e8e4d8;
				--sentinel-blue: #2a4a6b; --assault-red: #6b2a2a;
			}
			body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background: var(--forest-dark); color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.7; min-height: 100vh; }
			.container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }
			.nav { background: var(--forest-green); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--amber); padding: 1rem 0; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
			.nav .container { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; max-width: 1200px; }
			.logo { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--amber); text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.2rem; }
			.nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; }
			.nav-links a { color: var(--cream); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; transition: color 0.3s; }
			.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--amber); }
			.breadcrumb { padding: 2rem 0 1rem; }
			.breadcrumb a { color: var(--leaf-green); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
			.breadcrumb a:hover { color: var(--amber); }
			.page-header { padding: 2rem 0 3rem; text-align: center; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--amber); margin-bottom: 3rem; }
			.weapon-icon { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.weapon-icon img { width: 540px; height: 540px; object-fit: contain; }
			.page-header h1 { font-size: 3rem; color: var(--amber); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.subtitle { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--leaf-green); font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.stat-badges { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 1rem; }
			.stat-badge { padding: 0.5rem 1rem; background: var(--moss-green); color: var(--amber); border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1rem; }
			.content { padding-bottom: 4rem; }
			.weapon-section { background: var(--forest-green); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 2rem; border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.weapon-section.highlight { border-color: var(--amber); background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--forest-green) 0%, var(--moss-green) 100%); }
			.weapon-section h2 { color: var(--amber); font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
			.weapon-section h3 { color: var(--leaf-green); font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem; }
			.weapon-section p { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.weapon-section ul { margin-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.weapon-section li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.attributes-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; }
			.attribute-card { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.attribute-card h3 { color: var(--amber); font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.attribute-card p { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.attribute-card ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; }
			.attribute-card li { padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.attribute-card li:before { content: "▸"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--amber); }
			.formula { background: var(--moss-green); padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid var(--amber); font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-weight: 600; color: var(--amber); text-align: center; }
			.mechanic-details { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 1rem; }
			.damage-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: var(--forest-dark); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
			.damage-table th, .damage-table td { padding: 1rem; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.damage-table th { background: var(--moss-green); color: var(--amber); font-weight: 600; }
			.damage-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
			.technique-card { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--amber); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
			.technique-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.technique-header h3 { color: var(--amber); font-size: 1.75rem; margin: 0; }
			.technique-cost { background: var(--moss-green); padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: 6px; color: var(--amber); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; }
			.stance-split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
			.stance-block { padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 2px solid; }
			.stance-block.sentinel { background: rgba(42, 74, 107, 0.3); border-color: #4a7aab; }
			.stance-block.assault { background: rgba(107, 42, 42, 0.3); border-color: #ab4a4a; }
			.stance-label { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; }
			.stance-block.sentinel .stance-label { background: #4a7aab; color: #fff; }
			.stance-block.assault .stance-label { background: #ab4a4a; color: #fff; }
			.stance-block p { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
			.stance-block ul { margin-left: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.stance-block li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
			.playstyle-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; }
			.playstyle-card { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.playstyle-card.strengths { border-color: var(--leaf-green); }
			.playstyle-card.weaknesses { border-color: #c74440; }
			.playstyle-card h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--amber); }
			.playstyle-card ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; }
			.playstyle-card li { padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
			.playstyle-card li:before { content: "▸"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--amber); }
			@media (max-width: 768px) {
				.nav .container { flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
				.nav-links { gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
				.page-header h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
				.weapon-section { padding: 1.5rem; }
				.technique-header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem; }
				.stance-split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
			}
			html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
